[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3 uid="uid://unitdirshadowfarcaster"]

; Moves the caster's distance towards the sun. One slab hangs 400 units towards the sun, far past
; every split box, and its shadow falls on the ground the scene's camera sees. The depth pass flattens
; it onto each box's light side, so it casts in every split. Every other shadow golden keeps its
; casters inside the boxes.

